@startuml "Bridge - Window (Solution) - Object Diagram"
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
title The objects at run time — one window kind, two platforms, one class


object "anIconWindow : IconWindow" as w1
object "anXWindowImp : XWindowImp" as x1
w1 --> x1 : _imp

object "anIconWindow : IconWindow " as w2
object "aPMWindowImp : PMWindowImp" as p2
w2 --> p2 : _imp

note right of x1
  +----------------------+
  | +-+                  |
  | +-+ readme.txt       |
  +----------------------+
end note

note right of p2
  #======================#
  ! #=#                  !
  ! #=# readme.txt       !
  #======================#
end note

note as N1
  The <b>same IconWindow class</b> produced both pictures.
  Only the object on the right of the arrow differs — and
  it can be replaced on a window that already exists.
end note

@enduml
